# Line endings: teks selalu LF di repo dan di checkout (termasuk Windows),
# agar skrip bash (sh, CI) dan perbandingan byte (trace_src_sync) tidak
# terpengaruh core.autocrlf. Biner tidak dinormalisasi.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.tar binary
*.webp binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.o binary
*.a binary
*.so binary
